ABKAA"]]],null,"用餐人數",null,"0ahUKEwi9jrGex9KWAxXMcfUHHc2EO3AQ3IcHCH8oCQ",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["26_0516_2000\n\n路過進來吃，整體不太推薦。\n因為屬於台式創意拉麵，不評論細節。\n\n我點的是新菜色「金湯干貝拉麵」$280。麵體表現普通，屬於一般細麵，即使選了偏硬口感，也沒有日式拉麵常見的那種「生麵感」。\n\n湯頭和配料的風味，比較像泰式船麵結合台式黃麵的感覺，和傳統日式拉麵差異蠻大。我自己會把它歸類成偏台式創意拉麵。\n\n另外加點的咖哩飯 $150，走的是日式黑咖哩風格，但味道也偏普通，以這個價位來說不太值得。\n\n整體來說不到難吃，但也沒有什麼記憶點。如果是抱著期待吃正統日式拉麵的心情來，可能會有點失望。我個人不會回訪。",null,[0,27]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/10772877134792138708/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFrZDJGWFVscFpWVEZoVWtab2FtRkVUbEJaTUVwRVV6TmtSMVpIWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/10772877134792138708/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFrZDJGWFVscFpWVEZoVWtab2FtRkVUbEJaTUVwRVV6TmtSMVpIWXhBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/10772877134792138708/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFrZDJGWFVscFpWVEZoVWtab2FtRkVUbEJaTUVwRVV6TmtSMVpIWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/10772877134792138708/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFrZDJGWFVscFpWVEZoVWtab2FtRkVUbEJaTUVwRVV6TmtSMVpIWXhBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/10772877134792138708/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFrZDJGWFVscFpWVEZoVWtab2FtRkVUbEJaTUVwRVV6TmtSMVpIWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/10772877134792138708/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFrZDJGWFVscFpWVEZoVWtab2FtRkVUbEJaTUVwRVV6TmtSMVpIWXhBQhAA"]],[null,null,3826,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21kd2FXUlpZVTFhUkZoamFETlBZMEpEUzNkR1ZHYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x6e31a6f6bbca8085!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOmdwaWRZYU1aRFhjaDNPY0JDS3dGVGc%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21kd2FXUlpZVTFhUkZ